{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "019kur_402_2_4_019_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d7392df494beea118d015a454410c97165d1ff093078b8f60fa5d5e2e13dd286",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:019kur_402_2_4_019_02_09_a:2_4_019_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7283352cfbc932de2f54d7e775796830d11686147b9de257af027862370f074b",
      "text": "我是清澄。冒昧打扰您了。\n体育活动的工作，辛苦您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_402_2_4_019_02_09_a:2_4_019_02_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50309a1aba813bfb0fe58d3a0ff96f208b9c30b6e4d9b197eb2dd061640981f4",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n行进表演非常精彩",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_402_2_4_019_02_09_a:2_4_019_02_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6c2fdd0063c9e7318592d8fc029df97d996e6b5fc664682965ba3a6477bb7d6",
      "text": "能听到您这么说我很欣慰。\n没有白费平日的刻苦练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_402_2_4_019_02_09_a:2_4_019_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd0a957b68e1180e761afcbdff794ac0a04ab5e85f22d6c03363098e85e73725",
      "text": "能逢上晴天，真是太好了。毕竟唯独\n天气是无法凭努力改变的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_402_2_4_019_02_09_a:2_4_019_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0f5dfd725d48bb1827948bdd5ddce8b20c7b88b523c5c33a9c635193233866e",
      "text": "选手们能在最好的状态下\n迎来当天，真是比什么都好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_402_2_4_019_02_09_a:2_4_019_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11e78f558c957e4eb16bdb3788b9e992729e6689442f353ba61e0bb1479fbe47",
      "text": "仿佛连天空和太阳，\n都在为大家加油打气一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_402_2_4_019_02_09_a:2_4_019_02_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b80ce2de11b5fb84f0eebe689ec2443bd69560a371a2eb9471265f0fbc2f4c0",
      "text": "九郎先生看起来\n非常开心呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_402_2_4_019_02_09_a:2_4_019_02_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:864fba7423bfd825fe32ede9e3a2586012c95d6036425d96163689792aa331f4",
      "text": "是个让人心情舒畅的\n运动好天气呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_402_2_4_019_02_09_a:2_4_019_02_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b7e35d50f67c903202306c196c5715ee5a69dfc38d63eb00c3706e7dfe96763",
      "text": "是的。因为我对大家不仅是作为乐队指挥，\n更是发自内心地在为他们加油。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_402_2_4_019_02_09_a:2_4_019_02_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6113ebc3075222b2ed53c3258d728ea27d18b11611c2d8cd96a5f31958e8ed67",
      "text": "嗯。行进乐队的旗帜与指挥棒也映衬在\n蓝天之中，呈现出了前所未有的美丽。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_402_2_4_019_02_09_a:2_4_019_02_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19ec7ca077875bafcb6cd5a6a4cbfa5029c8e5e6d2dc17f70355e59184a00ad6",
      "text": "今后作为偶像，我也希望能积累\n各种各样的经验。那么，先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
